[00:00.00] 作词 : Roger Waters
[00:00.00][by:Mr_WaterRat]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[01:13.71]Icy wind of night, be gone.
[01:13.71]寒冷的晚风，远去吧
[01:16.50]This is not your domain.
[01:16.50]这里不是你的疆域
[01:21.79]In the sky a bird was heard to cry.
[01:21.79]天空中的鸟儿在哭泣
[01:30.19]Misty morning whisperings and gentle stirring sounds
[01:30.19]薄雾的清晨的低语和温柔的躁动
[01:39.59]Belied a deathly silence that lay all around.
[01:39.59]掩盖了四周死一般的沉寂
[01:47.96]Hear the lark and harken to the barking of the dog fox gone to ground.
[01:47.96]听云雀的婉转和潜伏的沙狐的低吠
[01:56.12]See the splashing of the kingfisher flashing to the water.
[01:56.12]看翠鸟溅起的水花闪着光芒
[02:03.75]And a river of green is sliding unseen beneath the trees,
[02:03.75]绿色的小河在树林里蜿蜒
[02:12.23]Laughing as it passes through the endless summer making for the sea.
[02:12.23]欢声笑语地在长夏归入海洋
[02:20.90]In the lazy water meadow
[02:20.90]我慵懒的躺在
[02:25.65]I lay me down.
[02:25.65]河边草地上
[02:29.34]All around me,
[02:29.34]周围的一切
[02:31.31]Golden sunflakes settle on the ground,
[02:31.31]太阳的金色碎片洒在大地上
[02:37.22]Basking in the sunshine of a by gone afternoon,
[02:37.22]沐浴在过往的午后阳光里
[02:45.50]Bringing sounds of yesterday into this city room.
[02:45.50]把昨日的声响带进新闻室
[02:54.55]Hear the lark and harken to the barking of the dog fox gone to ground.
[02:54.55]听云雀的婉转和潜伏的沙狐的低吠
